ion, execution budgets, termination records and the stated end-to-end timing criterion.","Check that bounded planning and execution preserve the epic's completeness and accuracy requirements and define observable outcomes when budgets are reached.","Inspect classifier, MCP entry, planner, validator and executor contracts against the upstream plan-builder design."],"dependsOn":["scope","broad","reporting"],"purpose":"substantive"},{"id":"handling","title":"Complete partitioned processing and aggregation","selectors":["/body/stories/2","/body/stories/2/acceptanceCriteria/0","/body/stories/2/acceptanceCriteria/1","/body/stories/2/acceptanceCriteria/2","/body/stories/2/acceptanceCriteria/3","/body/stories/2/acceptanceCriteria/4","/body/stories/2/acceptanceCriteria/5","/body/stories/2/acceptanceCriteria/6","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/2","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/14","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/15","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/16","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/17","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/18","/body/constraints/1","/body/constraints/2","/body/constraints/3","/body/constraints/6"],"concerns":["Assess handling methods for every size on both paths, whole small results, partition coverage and complete oversized-item reading.","Check preservation of findings across partition boundaries and repeated aggregation when intermediate or final combining inputs exceed model capacity.","Assess partial-failure preservation, coverage accounting and final completeness reporting.","Check closure of the accepted docs-family exception and compatibility with nested plans, execution budgets and sequential model calls.","Inspect applicable aggregation and content-reading evidence and necessary interaction or data-contract artifacts."],"dependsOn":["scope","broad","reporting","sizing"],"purpose":"substantive"},{"id":"retrieval","title":"Uncapped retrieval and authoritative item content","selectors":["/body/stories/3"