 L/XL recursion. Historical external measurements were assessed as recorded evidence; replaying those runs is optional for this scope assessment."]},{"chunkId":"broad","status":"changes_requested","summary":"All assigned selectors were inspected against the live DEF, canonical artifact, upstream designs, and relevant runtime and test sources. The s6–s8 capability boundaries and module-discovery approach are feasible, but s7's unconditional completion promises conflict with s9's budget-stopped outcome. No visual artifact is attached to this DEF; prose is sufficient for this epic-level scope.","findings":[{"id":"broad2-terminal-contract-01","severity":"MED","location":"/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/0","message":"Reconcile s7's lifecycle acceptance with s9's new budget-exhaustion outcome. s7/ac1 requires every stage to complete, s7/ac2 requires nested steps to run and reach the final report, and S007:FR001 repeats the unconditional completion promise. An accepted plan stopped by s9/ac4 deliberately leaves work unexecuted, even when no task fails. S007:FR003 qualifies completion only for the docs aggregation and code-module prerequisites; neither covers this new outcome. Distinguish full completion from an explicitly incomplete terminal report, qualify the nested-execution promise accordingly, and specify whether retrieving that terminal report under the same run follows s7/ac4's stored-result behavior.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/0",".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/1",".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/3",".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/29",".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/31","docs/epics/make-insrc-analysis-complete-used-right-E20261006b9d5c5c4/DEF.md:235","docs/epics/make-insrc-analysis-complete-used-right-E20261006b9d5c5c4/DEF.md:270","src/analyze/orchestrator/driver.ts — stored-result replay requires status=ok, stage=done, intent and finalReport","src/analyze/executor/walker.ts:340 — nested execution materializes each child's terminal report"]}],"inspectedReferences":["/body/stories/5","/body/stories/5/acceptanceCriteria/0","/body/stories/5/acceptanceCriteria/1","/body/stories/5/acceptanceCriteria/2","/body/stories/5/acceptanceCriteria/3","/body/stories/6","/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/0","/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/1","/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/2","/body/stories/6/acceptanceCriteria/3","/body/stories/7","/body/stories/7/acceptanceCriteria/0","/body/stories/7/acceptanceCriteria/1","/body/stories/7/acceptanceCriteria/2","/body/stories/7/acceptanceCriteria/3","/body/stories/7/acceptanceCriteria/4","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/6","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/27","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/28","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/29","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/30","/body/functionalDefinition/requirements/31","/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/docs/epics/make-insrc-analysis-complete-used-right-E20261006b9d5c5c4/DEF.md","/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json","/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/analyzer-def-s9-r1.json","DEF.md sections 2 and 6.3 — s3 closes the accepted oversized docs-aggregation exception","DEF.md sections 6.6–6.9 — entry, lifecycle, directory modules and revised execution policy","Canonical artifact envelope and body — no attached references, visual definitions or companions","design/analyze-context-builder.md:69 — bundle ownership, caching, lossless context and failure distinctions","design/analyze-plan-builder.md — nested report contracts, serial execution, depth policy, persistence and partial failures","design/analyze-framework-code.md — code-unit scope, discovery and functional-surface expectations","s