"},"rationale":"Current s5 explicitly depends on s1, s2, s3 and s4, establishing reporting, measurement, complete handling and retrieval before layout uncapping.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/stories/4/dependsOn","DEF.md section 6.5","Checkpoint attempt 2: scope and answers assessments"],"action":"resolved","reviewedInChunkIds":["scope","answers","consistency"]},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"scope","findingId":"scope-budget-02"},"rationale":"Current s9 permits children while prohibiting grandchildren for XL/L roots and specifies an explicitly incomplete budget terminal outcome. The residual contradiction with unconditional full-processing requirements is captured by the current replacement finding.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/stories/8/acceptanceCriteria/0",".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/body/stories/8/acceptanceCriteria/3","Checkpoint attempt 2: scope finding scope2-budget-contract-02","design/analyze-plan-builder.md:155–194"],"action":"superseded","reviewedInChunkIds":["scope","sizing","handling","consistency"],"supersededBy":{"chunkId":"scope","findingId":"scope2-budget-contract-02"}},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"scope","findingId":"scope-citation-03"},"rationale":"The historical failure retains c21, but assigning c22 to sampling collides with the existing triage identity. The current replacement records this remaining citation defect.","evidenceReferences":[".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/citations/18",".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/citations/19",".insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json#/citations/20","Checkpoint attempt 2: scope finding scope2-citation-01"],"action":"superseded","reviewedInChunkIds":["scope","consistency"],"supersededBy":{"chunkId":"scope","findingId":"scope2-citation-01"}},{"source":{"attempt":1,"chunkId":"reporting","findingId":"reporting-unknown-total-01"},"rationale":"Revised s1/ac1 requires establishe