able in prose; no additional diagram is necessary at this stage.","Supporting tests were inspected as source evidence; test execution and live-model validation were not performed in this design review."]},{"chunkId":"consistency","status":"passed","summary":"Completed fresh whole-artifact reconciliation. All 127 inventory units have substantive inspection declarations across the seven completed capability reviews, with no mandatory verification gaps. Current Markdown and canonical content match the attempt baseline; acceptance criteria and requirement representations agree. Dependencies are acyclic, s5 and s9 now declare their prerequisites, and s3/s8 explicitly close s7's original exceptions. Reconciled all 13 prior finding origins against inspected current evidence. Remaining citation, budget/completeness, lifecycle and benchmark defects are already recorded by current substantive chunks; no additional distinct finding is warranted. This chunk's passed status does not clear those findings. No attached or additionally necessary visual artifact was identified at DEF stage.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/docs/epics/make-insrc-analysis-complete-used-right-E20261006b9d5c5c4/DEF.md","/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/analyzer-def-s9-r1.json","/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json","Checkpoint attempt 1: completed report and all 13 effective finding origins","Checkpoint attempt 2: all seven completed substantive assessments, inventory, coverage plan and current baseline","DEF.md sections 2–6: flattened requirements, constraints, all nine stories and dependency graph","DEF.md sections 7–8, Resolved questions and Citations","Canonical body and meta.envelope: no visual definitions, companions or attachments","design/analyze-plan-builder.md: plan ownership, validation, XL children, depth ceilings, persistence and partial failures","design/analyze-context-builder.md:69–18