ier chunks; no additional finding is introduced. No diagram or UX artifact is attached or necessary at this DEF stage.","findings":[],"inspectedReferences":["/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/docs/epics/make-insrc-analysis-complete-used-right-E20261006b9d5c5c4/DEF.md","/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/.insrc/tmp/design-review/analyzer-def-s9-r1.json","/home/subho/work/dev/insors/insrc/.insrc/artifacts/DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574.json","Checkpoint attempt 3 completed feedback: scope, broad, completeness, sizing, handling, planning, retrieval, answers","DEF.md:28-80 — shared and story-level functional requirements","DEF.md:120-271 — prerequisite ordering and acceptance contracts","DEF.md:294-304 — citation identities and resolved steering question","design/analyze-context-builder.md — lossless context, ownership, sizing and failure contracts","design/analyze-plan-builder.md — recursive planning, measured child scopes, validation and partial failures","design/analyze-framework.md:35-50 — measured sizing and inverted depth policy","design/analyze-framework.md:245-270 — nested execution and aggregation provenance","docs/epics/make-insrc-analysis-complete-used-right-E20261006b9d5c5c4/S009/EXT.md — originating s9 requirements"],"limitations":[],"advice":["Retain the earlier findings scope3-budget-contract-01, broad3-terminal-contract-01 and handling3-budget-coverage-01 together when reconciling complete coverage with budget-stopped terminal reports.","Keep planning-xl-completion-01 distinct: truthful incomplete reporting does not demonstrate successful completion of the XL benchmark or closure of the docs aggregation exception.","The duplicated citation identity remains covered by scope3-citation-02. Historical steering wording and missing stable s8/s9 requirement identities remain useful cleanup advice.","Carry the replacement root-depth policy into upstream documentation during implementation. Live benchmarks and tests were not executed for this read-only DEF consistency assessment."]}],"limitations":[],"reviewer":"daemon","reviewedContentIdentity":"ae4e5e9c1f912e94c32f69fc02a15301e9151df7026e566452d39ca8e9498c34"},"finishedAt":"2026-11-14T07:13:50.695Z","publication":{"reviewId":"analyzer-def-s9-r1","attempt":3,"state":"pending","error":{"code":"publication_failed","summary":"DEF-b9d5c5c40df5a574 is in conflict (hash-mismatch); a person has to resolve it before this can proceed"},"actions":[{"actionId":"retry-publication-def-s9-r1-a3","signature":"3ecb05f98823d68454d7ac2849dafa537e191c48e1ea98716ba92012f8bf846e"}]},"acceptedAt":"2026-11-14T06:56:53.023Z","resourceGuard":{"daemonInstance":"b361638a-b6bf-42ea-8be7-8d610ff4bbeb","openLeases":[]}}],"admissionFailures":[]}}}}
